OL,5,G0350 From That Small Island            
OL,6,     FNew Worlds: the First Irish       
OL,7,     FDiaspora: Between 1600 and 1700,  
OL,8,     Fcontinental Europe was the main   
OL,9,     Fdestination for tens of thousands 
OL,10,     Fof Irish migrants. This was the   
OL,11,     Ffirst Irish diaspora.             
